---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="ArkheionX Roadmap" description="Public-safe ArkheionX roadmap without date promises.">
  <header class="page-intro page-shell">
    <p class="page-kicker">Public direction</p>
    <h1>Roadmap.</h1>
    <p>Current source state and intended work. Sequence may change; no dates or delivery promises are attached.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="page-shell prose-section">
    <div class="timeline">
      <article class="current">
        <p class="timeline-label">CURRENT</p>
        <h2>v3.9.0 public-safe source state</h2>
        <p>Local review artifacts, protocol mapping, review packages, deterministic fixture benchmarks, source fingerprints, and snapshot drift checks.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="timeline-label">NEXT SURFACE</p>
        <h2>Official website</h2>
        <p>Static developer documentation, source installer, public safety model, and deployment operations.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="timeline-label">DISTRIBUTION</p>
        <h2>Installer polish and binary release pipeline</h2>
        <p>Improve source-install verification, then define reproducible binary packaging and publication. No binary is currently published.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="timeline-label">DOCUMENTATION</p>
        <h2>Stronger docs</h2>
        <p>Expand artifact schemas, review workflows, troubleshooting, and examples while keeping public claims tied to implemented behavior.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="timeline-label">ARCHITECTURE</p>
        <h2>v4.0 architecture</h2>
        <p>Refine the protocol intelligence boundaries, optional static parser adapters, and a focused review workspace.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
